# chorus golden vector: mic state (live), protocol v2 message type 0x3B.
#
# Committed, and never written by a test. Any implementation of chorus protocol v2 must
# produce these exact bytes from the canonical input in mic_state_live.fields, and recover
# exactly those fields from them (docs/protocol.md, "0x3B mic state").
#
# Format: whitespace separated hex bytes, '#' starts a comment.

# frame header: type 0x3B, payload length 1 (0x0001), big-endian
3B 00 01

# gate = 1 (live)
01
